# Workspace layout

This workspace holds planning docs plus two applications. Each application is its own project and will be its own git repository.

- `backend/` — Express API. Domain code lives in `src/modules/<module>/`.
- `frontend/` — React app. Product code lives in `src/features/<feature>/`.

Do not add a shared package. The API contract (paths, request bodies, status enums, error codes) is the boundary. Change the API first, then the web client.

When editing `backend/`, follow the backend module, TypeScript, API, and Prisma rules. When editing `frontend/`, follow the feature, React, data-fetching, and dashboard rules.
